                                        "expectedOutput": "Ekuivalensi Matematis Konvolusi 1x1 (FCN Long et al. 2015):\nDimensi Feature Map Masukan: (3, 3, 4)\nDimensi Tensor Output 1x1   : (3, 3, 2)\nNilai Output Piksel (1, 2) via Conv 1x1: [-1.23580002784729, 2.6382999420166016]\nNilai Output Piksel (1, 2) via Lapisan FC: [-1.23580002784729, 2.6382999420166016]\nSelisih Maksimum Absolut: 0.00e+00",
