                                        "expectedOutput": "Distribusi Sampel Fine Network Berdasarkan Bobot Coarse:\nSampel Fine t = 0.000\nSampel Fine t = 0.776\nSampel Fine t = 0.836\nSampel Fine t = 0.895\nSampel Fine t = 0.955\nSampel Fine t = 1.034\nSampel Fine t = 1.177\nSampel Fine t = 2.000\n\nHierarchical sampling memfokuskan alokasi komputasi pada permukaan objek nyata.",
